{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"examples","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Examples"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Want to skip to the implementation? Check out these examples:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../examples/custom-steps","children":[{"type":"text","value":"custom-steps"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The API below described how to use the "},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"custom-steps"}]},{"type":"text","value":" features."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Options"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"steps","children":[{"type":"text","value":"steps"}]},{"type":"code","value":"steps: Array<number>","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"An array of custom steps to use. This will override "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"stepSize"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"ticks","children":[{"type":"text","value":"ticks"}]},{"type":"code","value":"ticks: Array<number>","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"An array of custom ticks to use. This will override "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tickSize"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"api","children":[{"type":"text","value":"API"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"getticks","children":[{"type":"text","value":"getTicks"}]},{"type":"code","value":"getTicks: () =>\n  ReadonlyArray<{ value: number; key: number; percentage: number }>","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Ticks to be rendered. Each "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tick"},{"type":"text","value":" has the following props:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"value: number"},{"type":"text","value":" - The tick number to be displayed"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"key: number"},{"type":"text","value":" - The key of a tick"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"percentage: number"},{"type":"text","value":" - Percentage value of where tick should be placed on ranger"}]}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"examples","text":"Examples","level":2},{"id":"options","text":"Options","level":2},{"id":"steps","text":"steps","level":3},{"id":"ticks","text":"ticks","level":3},{"id":"api","text":"API","level":2},{"id":"getticks","text":"getTicks","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n## Examples\n\nWant to skip to the implementation? Check out these examples:\n\n- [custom-steps](../examples/custom-steps)\n\nThe API below described how to use the **custom-steps** features.\n\n## Options\n\n### steps\n\n```ts\nsteps: Array<number>\n```\n\nAn array of custom steps to use. This will override `stepSize`\n\n### ticks\n\n```ts\nticks: Array<number>\n```\n\nAn array of custom ticks to use. This will override `tickSize`\n\n## API\n\n### getTicks\n\n```tsx\ngetTicks: () =>\n  ReadonlyArray<{ value: number; key: number; percentage: number }>\n```\n\nTicks to be rendered. Each `tick` has the following props:\n\n- `value: number` - The tick number to be displayed\n- `key: number` - The key of a tick\n- `percentage: number` - Percentage value of where tick should be placed on ranger\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nname: Custom Steps\nroute: /api/custom-steps\nmenu: API\n---\n\n## Examples\n\nWant to skip to the implementation? Check out these examples:\n\n- [custom-steps](../examples/custom-steps)\n\nThe API below described how to use the **custom-steps** features.\n\n## Options\n\n### steps\n\n```ts\nsteps: Array<number>\n```\n\nAn array of custom steps to use. This will override `stepSize`\n\n### ticks\n\n```ts\nticks: Array<number>\n```\n\nAn array of custom ticks to use. This will override `tickSize`\n\n## API\n\n### getTicks\n\n```tsx\ngetTicks: () =>\n  ReadonlyArray<{ value: number; key: number; percentage: number }>\n```\n\nTicks to be rendered. Each `tick` has the following props:\n\n- `value: number` - The tick number to be displayed\n- `key: number` - The key of a tick\n- `percentage: number` - Percentage value of where tick should be placed on ranger\n"}
